  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring and Support Action (MASA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objective of this new and large facility that shall cover all of the priority areas of the Global and Transregional Threats and Challenges is to increase the coherence of EU programming on security threats in a holistic way, taking account of interlinkages and crossovers between different threats, such as the impact of conflict on terrorism, organised crime, climate, CBRN and critical infrastructure and vice versa. It shall also facilitate the creation of synergies, both thematic and geographical, between all components of the Programme.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
